    {
      "title": "The Iran war is unpopular, but will it cost Trump the midterms? Our reporters answer your questions",
      "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/community/live/2026/oct/05/reader-q-a-iran-war-trump-midterms-reporter-answers",
      "description": "<p>The war with Iran is reshaping America ahead of the midterms – how will it affect US voters at the polls? Join us for a live conversation on 6 October at 12pm ET with political and global correspondents</p><ul><li><p><a href=\"https://profile.theguardian.com/signin\"><strong>Sign in or sign up</strong></a> to join the conversation</p></li></ul><p>Welcome to our latest US midterms live Q&amp;A – just over a month away from election day on 3 November.</p><p>The war with Iran has had major implications for <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/business/2026/aug/07/flight-travel-costs-iran-war\">Americans’ wallets</a>, government spending and US foreign policy. It’s has also been an important factor in <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/world/ng-interactive/2026/aug/08/trump-iran-war-criticism-groundhog-day\">reshaping the political landscape</a> as the war enters its eighth month, with the 2026 US midterms quickly approaching.</p><p><em><a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/community/live/2026/sep/15/reader-qa-how-united-are-the-democrats-ahead-of-the-midterms-post-your-questions-now\">The makeup of the Democratic party, plus key races to watch</a></em></p><p><em><a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/community/live/2026/sep/24/reader-qa-ask-our-reporting-team-about-whos-spending-what-on-the-midterms\">Who are the groups financially backing the candidates in the midterms?</a></em></p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/community/live/2026/oct/05/reader-q-a-iran-war-trump-midterms-reporter-answers\">Continue reading...</a>",
      "source_name": "The Guardian World",
